1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
This ship is rapidly losing altitude.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
It is up to us, Cooper.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Down here!

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
We are approaching the ARC's containment unit.

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:35,000
The containment unit is too large to carry. We must improvise!

6
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,000
What are we doing?

7
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
I cannot reach the Ark. Cooper, I need your help.

8
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
6,000 meters.

9
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Quickly, we need to get off the ship.

10
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,000
We are running out of time.

11
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:18,000
6,000 meters.

12
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,000
This way, Cooper.

13
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Holy crap, P.E.T.

14
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:33,160
E.T. No! What are you doing?

15
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,480
Protocol 3.

16
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:37,880
Get the arc out of here!

17
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:38,860
E.T. Run!

18
00:01:38,860 --> 00:01:45,020
If we are trapped, I will not lose another pilot. Brace for impact.

19
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:04,180
Oh my God, that was horrible.

20
00:02:04,180 --> 00:02:07,180
Oh my God.
